      en: "Cinesphere is a spherical movie theatre at Ontario Place in Toronto, Ontario. Opened in 1971, it was the world's first IMAX cinema. The sphere measures 20 meters in diameter and houses a screen of 930 square meters. Designed by architect Arthur Erickson. It screens IMAX documentaries. Ontario Place is a waterfront entertainment complex on three artificial islands. Cinesphere underwent a major renovation in 2011 and reopened in 2017.",
